  "scenario": "09-broken-inheritance",
  "title": "Broken inheritance",
  "description": "Payroll sets SE_DACL_PROTECTED, so the parent's Finance-RW grant stops at its boundary. Only the local group holding Full Control reaches it \u2014 which is itself an escalation path worth reporting.",
